# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The app moved from the site root to /app/ when it got a real domain. Links
# already sent by email — club setup links, payment links, Stripe return URLs —
# carry the old shape and would otherwise 404. Query strings are preserved by
# default, which matters because those links carry ?code=, ?athlete=,
# ?club_verify= and ?session_id=.
#
# Only the specific old entry points are redirected, not a blanket rule, so a
# genuinely wrong URL still 404s instead of silently landing on the app.

/index.html            /app/   301
/?code=:code           /app/?code=:code   301
/playfund-app/*        /app/:splat   301
